beats.visual:
THE RULE, MARKED ON EVERY STAGE. Staircase geometry, card states and the marker are exactly W1 32_stages.js (st_LX, st_LY, st_CW 230, st_MAIN, st_card, st_mkAt, st_ewM), stored in plate space via ewP.
- 17.09 cut:
  - the base pool .18 is on at once;
  - a floor RIPPLE fires on the cut (fRipple R 6 m, d 0.9, clipped at the near plane);
  - the PAD rim traces 17.11-17.45 (RED decal, dash progress), inner white .14 over 17.21-17.45.
- 17.52 «القاعدة»: READOUT line 1 rises: the WITHDRAW symbol (K4) draws 17.52-17.92 and «القاعدة» rises (0.45 s expo, 20 px).
- 17.52-17.82: the ground line runs from the pad's right edge (1060,742) to x 1780 (expo).
- 17.60-18.20: the stair line climbs (dash progress, e4).
- 17.70-18.30: the six TAG stage cards pop in the DIM state (0.08 s stagger, S1 → S6).
- 18.41, «يتم» (after the pause 18.01-18.41):
  - S1 turns DONE (red top-left cut + white tick, 0.3 s): video 1's stage, passed;
  - S2 LIGHTS (0.35 s: PANEL, RED rim, DOME draws 18.45-18.95, '$20,000' on the card);
  - the flag MARKER drops 6 px onto S2 (18.45-18.77): you are here.
- 19.62-20.52, «في جميع مراحل» (19.62 / 20.30): THE RULE MARK, landing by landing (design_system 13).
  - A red COMET (kit comet, K13: head r 7, glow 26, 6-dot tail at 9 px) runs st_MAIN from the pad to S6 in 0.90 s (eio).
  - When its head reaches landing k's right end (K13 passTimes on st_MAIN; for S1 the first riser at x 1540), that landing gets three layers, in plate space via ewP:
    1. OPEN WINDOW: a 5 px white α 1 segment over the 3 px line, from xR = st_LX[k] + 240 to xR − 64 (draws right to left, 0.10 s);
    2. FIRST TRADE, 0.10 s later: a RED 3x22 tick at x xR − 64, y st_LY[k] − 6 to + 16, dropping 10 px into place (0.15 s e4);
    3. LOCKED, with 2: the rest of the landing (st_LX[k] to xR − 64) dims from white .7 to .25 (0.2 s).
  - Time on a landing runs the way you walk it (right to left: you step on at its right end), so each landing is B-roll 1's timeline in miniature, mirrored. The stage cards do not flash or take badges: the landings carry the rule.
- 20.30 «مراحل»: readout line 2 «في جميع المراحل» rises (0.45 s expo, 20 px). 20.55-20.80: its rule-mark glyph draws at the line's left end (the bar right to left in 0.10 s, then the RED tick drops 6 px, 0.15 s e4).
- 21.17 «Axi», 21.53 «Select»:
  - 21.17: the six rule marks pop once together, as a visible accent (they are already white, so not a white flash): the open segments thicken 5 → 9 → 5 px and the RED ticks scale 1 → 1.3 → 1 about their tops (0.25 s);
  - 21.17: a STAGE PULSE fires from the pad (fRipple R 2.1 m, d 0.8).
- Exit: nothing continues into L1.
  - 21.40-21.62: the readout and marker fade as one layer (eio);
  - 21.42-21.62: the cards fold into their landings (scaleY → 0 toward the line, S6 first, 0.008 s stagger);
  - 21.44-21.64: the line retracts toward the pad, and each landing's rule mark goes with its landing;
  - 21.44-21.66: the pad and pool go out.
- The cut is at 21.85.

