kit_additions.spec:
Move the delivered W1 34_broll.js world into the kit, so both B-roll groups share it: br_LAD, br_ladder, br_floorFill, br_floor, br_haze, br_bokehLayer and br_bokeh, plus the smoothstep br_ss (exported as ss).
brScene:
- draws br_haze(x) and br_bokeh(x, lt, o.bokehY) 1:1, outside the drift;
- then sets the drift (scale 1 + 0.005·lt about (960,540));
- calls br_floor(x, o.cz0 + 1.2·lt);
- awaits draw(x) inside the same transform, and restores.
